# Same as 2026-10-02-23b.play but camera:0 (FAR) instead of camera:6 (FACE),
# for a direct side-by-side comparison of the zoom extremes in a live pull.

open
tap settings
tap camera:0
note camera set to FAR (farthest), before entering a real pull
tap back

tap raid
tap next
tap class:mage:frost
tap pull
waitscreen fight 15
shot far-opening
play idle 20
shot far-mid
state
